WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Running a dive center is the best job in the world.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.800
The paperwork?

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.080
Not so much.

4
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:12.640
Meet Scubook, the all-in-one CRM, built by a Dive Center for Dive Centers.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.680
Bookings, check-ins, payments, and commissions.

6
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.720
Everything in one place.

7
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.400
Let's see how it works.

8
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.960
You open Scubook, and in about a minute,

9
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.960
you create your own space.

10
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.760
It starts with your name.

11
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.920
Then your dive center's name.

12
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.880
Blue Reef Divers in this example.

13
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.200
Now the part everyone loves.

14
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.480
Upload your own logo, and it follows you everywhere.

15
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.600
In the app, on your QR poster, and on your guest's check-in page.

16
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.800
Choose your colors, for the header and for the buttons,

17
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.560
and the whole app instantly matches your brand.

18
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.040
No installation, no credit card.

19
00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.240
Just start and step inside.

20
00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.080
This is your home screen.

21
00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.120
At the top, today's numbers, what you collected,

22
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.650
how many bookings, and what is still pending.

23
00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:07.930
Below, today's schedule, morning by morning,

24
00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.890
with the instructor on every activity.

25
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:13.850
And on the right, everything still to collect,

26
00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.810
so nobody leaves without paying.

27
00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.410
Now, check-in.

28
00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:22.010
Print this poster with your logo and put it on your counter.

29
00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.530
Your guest scans the QR code with her phone.

30
00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:29.050
It opens your own check-in form in your colors.

31
00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:31.770
She fills in her name and contact details,

32
00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:35.930
her certification level, everything you used to write on paper.

33
00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:39.610
Then her emergency contact, and her equipment sizes,

34
00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.130
fins, weights.

35
00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:44.250
Your team never has to ask again.

36
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.250
She accepts the consent, taps send, and she is done.

37
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.980
Not a single sheet of paper.

38
00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:53.050
And now the magic.

39
00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.930
Back on your home screen, a new section appeared.

40
00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.610
New check-ins to book.

41
00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:59.370
Sophia is already there.

42
00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.900
Nothing to retype.

43
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.200
One click on booking, and the form is already filled,

44
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.560
with her name and the activity she asked for.

45
00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.120
Choose the instructor and the dive site.

46
00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:17.200
The price, the agency fees, and the instructor's commission are all calculated for you.

47
00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.480
Save, and the booking is done.

48
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.440
Everything she entered is in her customer file.

49
00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.440
Contact, certification, sizes, emergency contact.

50
00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:31.280
All in one place, always up to date.

51
00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.920
On the schedule, you see your whole day.

52
00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.800
Who dives with which instructor, at what time,

53
00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.240
and where.

54
00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:41.600
And Sophia is already on it.

55
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.280
Now, payments.

56
00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:47.200
Cash, card, or QRIS, partial or full.

57
00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.440
Pick the booking, choose the method, and enter the amount.

58
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:55.360
And your takings update instantly on the home screen.

59
00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:01.290
Your price list lives here, with the agency fees and the costs for each course.

60
00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:06.530
Marketing shows you where your customers come from and what actually works.

61
00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.250
Inventory tracks your tanks, regulators,

62
00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.370
and wetsuits, and who has what.

63
00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.730
And your team.

64
00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.740
Each person has a role and sees only what they need.

65
00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:19.570
Payroll is private.

66
00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:24.850
Protect it with your own password, so only the right people see commissions.

67
00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:30.610
Then, Scubook calculates the commission of every instructor automatically from the activities

68
00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.300
they really did.

69
00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.290
And paying your instructors?

70
00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:39.490
You choose individual commission, calculated for each instructor.

71
00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:44.220
Or a shared pool, split fairly between everyone who worked.

72
00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.450
Scubook does all the math.

73
00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.170
Just untick whoever was away.

74
00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:51.490
Finally, make it yours.

75
00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:56.300
Your logo, your colors, and the right access for every role.

76
00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.490
Scubook.

77
00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.800
Less admin, more diving.

78
00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.160
Try the free demo today at scubook.app.

